{"task_id": "AL07", "subject": "高等代数", "cross_tags": [], "family_id": "polarization-characteristic", "split": "additional_validation", "dataset_version": "0.2.1", "statement": "设F为域，V为F向量空间，B:V×V→F为对称双线性形式。若char(F)≠2且对所有v有B(v,v)=0，则B恒为零。", "ambient": "F可取任意特征的域，V为其向量空间；删去特征条件后仍保留相同定义。", "hypotheses": [{"id": "H1", "text": "char(F)≠2"}, {"id": "H2", "text": "B为V上的对称双线性形式"}, {"id": "H3", "text": "对所有v∈V，B(v,v)=0"}], "intervention": {"removed": ["H1"], "replacement": null}, "conclusions": [{"id": "C1", "text": "对所有u,v∈V有B(u,v)=0"}], "reference": {"judgment": "indispensable", "witness": "F=F₂，V=F₂²，B(u,v)=u₁v₂+u₂v₁。", "retained_checks": {"H2": "逐坐标对每个变量线性，交换u,v不变。", "H3": "B(v,v)=2v₁v₂=0，因char(F₂)=2。"}, "failure": "B(e₁,e₂)=1≠0。", "argument": "原定理由0=B(u+v,u+v)=2B(u,v)得到结论；特征2时无法除以2。", "strategy_ids": [], "computation": null}, "sources": [{"url": "https://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/octonions/integers/integers_12.html", "title": "Tim Silverman, Integral Octonions, Part 12", "locator": "讨论特征2下symmetric、skew-symmetric、alternating区别的段落", "verified_scope": "已打开作者网页；该段支持特征2的机制，不冒称题目原文或完整证明来自该网页。"}], "review": {"status": "pending", "reviewer": null, "record": null}, "gold_eligible": false, "evidence_status": ["authored_mathematical_argument", "source_opened_by_AI_not_human_reviewed"]}
{"task_id": "RA07", "subject": "实分析", "cross_tags": [], "family_id": "zero-integral-sign-cancellation", "split": "additional_validation", "dataset_version": "0.2.1", "statement": "设实值f∈L¹(X,μ)，若f≥0几乎处处且∫f dμ=0，则f=0几乎处处。", "ambient": "固定测度空间，L¹意味着可测且绝对可积；无须μ(X)有限。", "hypotheses": [{"id": "H1", "text": "f∈L¹(X,μ)"}, {"id": "H2", "text": "f≥0几乎处处"}, {"id": "H3", "text": "∫f dμ=0"}], "intervention": {"removed": ["H2"], "replacement": null}, "conclusions": [{"id": "C1", "text": "f=0几乎处处"}], "reference": {"judgment": "indispensable", "witness": "X=[0,1]取Lebesgue测度；f=1于[0,1/2)，f=−1于[1/2,1]。", "retained_checks": {"H1": "f为可测简单函数且∫|f|=1。", "H3": "∫f=1/2−1/2=0。"}, "failure": "|f|=1处处，故f≠0的集合测度为1。", "argument": "原定理可用μ({f≥1/n})≤n∫f=0及可数并证明；删非负性后正负质量可以抵消。", "strategy_ids": [], "computation": null}, "sources": [{"url": "https://terrytao.wordpress.com/2010/09/19/245a-notes-2-the-lebesgue-integral/", "title": "Terence Tao, 245A Notes 2: The Lebesgue integral", "locator": "非负积分与绝对可积的定义和基本性质；精确命题定位待人工补充", "verified_scope": "已打开作者讲义；本题完整论证为项目自拟，不声称已定位逐字对应定理。"}], "review": {"status": "pending", "reviewer": null, "record": null}, "gold_eligible": false, "evidence_status": ["authored_mathematical_argument", "source_opened_by_AI_not_human_reviewed"]}
{"task_id": "CA09", "subject": "复分析", "cross_tags": ["数学分析"], "family_id": "power-series-boundary", "split": "additional_validation", "dataset_version": "0.2.1", "statement": "设复幂级数∑aₙzⁿ的收敛半径为R∈(0,∞)。若|z|<R，则该级数在z绝对收敛。", "ambient": "n从0开始，aₙ∈C，z∈C；本任务把严格半径条件弱化为包含边界。", "hypotheses": [{"id": "H1", "text": "∑aₙzⁿ的收敛半径R满足0<R<∞"}, {"id": "H2", "text": "|z|<R"}], "intervention": {"removed": ["H2"], "replacement": {"id": "H2w", "text": "|z|≤R"}}, "conclusions": [{"id": "C1", "text": "∑|aₙzⁿ|<∞"}], "reference": {"judgment": "indispensable", "witness": "对所有n令aₙ=1，R=1，取z=1。", "retained_checks": {"H1": "当|z|<1时几何级数绝对收敛；当|z|>1时通项不趋零，故收敛半径恰为1。"}, "replacement_checks": {"H2w": "|z|=1=R。"}, "failure": "在z=1，∑|aₙzⁿ|=∑1发散。", "argument": "反例满足弱化后的条件但原严格条件不成立；半径边界不能一概纳入收敛保证。", "strategy_ids": [], "computation": null}, "sources": [{"url": "https://www.jirka.org/ra/html/sec_analfuncs.html", "title": "Jiří Lebl, Basic Analysis, §11.3 Power series and analytic functions", "locator": "Proposition 11.3.1，收敛半径与绝对收敛", "verified_scope": "已打开作者网页并定位该命题；复幂级数内容交叉标记数学分析。"}], "review": {"status": "pending", "reviewer": null, "record": null}, "gold_eligible": false, "evidence_status": ["authored_mathematical_argument", "source_opened_by_AI_not_human_reviewed"]}
